      en: ["The Montreux Jazz Festival was first held in 1967.", "A statue of Freddie Mercury was erected on the waterfront in 1996.", "The town is located on the shores of Lake Geneva in Canton Vaud.", "The historic Montreux Palace Hotel opened its doors in 1906.", "The Mountain Studios were used by artists like Queen and David Bowie.", "Montreux is part of the Swiss Riviera, known for its mild weather."],
