      en: ["Built between 1270 and 1282 by the Counts of Gruyères.", "The complex features a square layout typical of Savoyard fortifications.", "The castle was acquired by the Canton of Fribourg in 1938.", "It currently houses a museum with over 170,000 annual visitors.", "Contains murals by the famous French painter Jean-Baptiste-Camille Corot.", "The HR Giger Museum is located in the immediate vicinity."],
