      en: ["Construction of the port was completed in 1954 as part of the Rhine regulation.", "The facility features approximately 2.3 kilometers of berthing space.", "It is a central location for the storage of Switzerland's strategic oil reserves.", "The port area covers roughly 45 hectares of dedicated industrial land.", "The Birsfelden lock system manages the water level difference for navigation.", "Direct access to the A2 highway facilitates rapid inland distribution of cargo."],
