      en: ["The Bernina Line was added to the UNESCO World Heritage list in 2008.", "Ospizio Bernina is the highest point of the railway line at 2,253 m.", "The railway manages gradients of up to 7% without using a rack system.", "The Brusio spiral viaduct has a diameter of approximately 70 meters.", "The entire route between St. Moritz and Tirano is 61 kilometers long.", "The line was already operated electrically when it opened in 1910."],
